{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1380450-anything-on-mages-in-portland-or-in-published-material-besides-in-the-bitter-road","id":1380450,"title":"Anything on Mages in Portland, OR in Published Material Besides In the Bitter Road?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-04-11T12:47:39-07:00","id":1380450,"title":"Anything on Mages in Portland, OR in Published Material Besides In the Bitter Road?","content":"I am running a Mage campaign set in Portland, Oregon in 2040, which is a follow-up to a short prior campaign.<br /> <br /> Reading the Bitter Road, the book published in 2000 about how to survive in the aftermath of the Avatar Storm, there's a mention of a Portland, Oregon chantry (page 6). I was wondering if there was any published chantry in Portland, Oregon, or if I should do some more backstory myself..<br /> <br /> Thanks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13680-baakyocalder","name":"baakyocalder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13680_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"353"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-11T14:45:13-07:00","id":1380495,"title":"","content":"Not that I can remember, no. There's a few odds and ends about Seattle or Vancouver (2nd ed Book of Storytellers Secrets and the original Syndicate book, respectively), but I think what you mention is about it for Oregon. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-11T15:43:39-07:00","id":1380504,"title":"","content":"Seattle has a chantry operating out of The Magic Box in Hidden Lore, which was the book of Storytellers Secrets for 2e (also material that didn't fit into the main book). Vancouver, British Columbia, is the Vancouver in the original Syndicate book. I've read those both and have the PDF of Hidden Lore.<br /> <br /> Thanks.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13680-baakyocalder","name":"baakyocalder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13680_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"353"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}